      "message": "feat(ui): accessible names for the fixture dialogs' and rows' input widgets\n\nSlice of #1119: the plate, vise, accessory and library dialogs and the\nfixture/plate/mod-vise rows name their DragValue, TextEdit and ComboBox\ninputs through AccessKit (labelled_by the row's label, or a plain name\nwhere nothing is drawn). Nothing visible changes. Guard tests walk the\ndialogs and the page and fail on an unnamed input.\n\nRefs #1119\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
